      <uighur>qub</uighur>
      <cyrillic>хув</cyrillic>
      <transcript>XUB</transcript>
      <definition>intensifying adv. particle used before certain adj. and adv. beginning with the syllable xu- or xaγu-</definition>
      <page>975</page>
      <examples>
